   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; the question screens out Schedule 1 line 24d (reforestation amortization and expenses, outside this tool). Its window is the section 194 amortization: i4562 (2025) p. 18, Qualified forestation and reforestation costs (section 194), 'You can elect to amortize the qualifying costs that are not deducted currently over an 84-month period', so costs paid in 2025 or in the seven years before can still give a 2025 deduction. The reviewer had only Schedule 1's text; the rendered question is supported by the source and refuses every return it should.",
